    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enhanced Document Processing with Curation\n\n### New Features:\n- **Version Tracking**: Every document gets a version record with content hash\n- **Quality Scoring**: Automatic quality assessment based on chunk count, token distribution, and metadata\n- **Auto-Approval**: High-quality documents (score ≥ 0.7) are automatically approved\n- **Curation Queue**: All documents are added to curation queue for tracking\n- **Manual Review**: Lower-quality documents trigger curator notifications\n\n### Quality Score Components:\n1. Chunk count optimization (0-0.3)\n2. Token count distribution (0-0.3)\n3. Metadata presence (0.2)\n4. Filename quality (0.2)\n\n### Curation Workflow:\n- **Auto-Approved**: Quality ≥ 0.7 → status='approved'\n- **Manual Review**: Quality < 0.7 → status='pending', notify curators\n- **Failed**: Processing error → status='failed'",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-curation-info",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Curation Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1700, 400]
    }
